WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:09.471
A card is opened from the Table view. The view is then switched to the canvas, and the card is closed. Pressing Back now brings the table back, with its address.

00:00:10.423 --> 00:00:19.983
A link to a card that carries view equals table, followed inside the page, opens the card over the table. Closed, it lands on the table instead of the canvas.
